cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this formalization, please cite the Palomar registry record."
title: "Sharp symmetry bounds for real plane algebraic curves (Theorem 1) in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of Theorem 1 on Euclidean symmetry groups of
  real plane algebraic curves: finiteness, a cyclic direct part of order at most
  max(d, 2d - 4), a full group of order at most 2d, sharpness in every degree,
  and the classification of the extremal curves for d >= 5.
